<title>USA: FOCUS-U.S. distillates stocks build but still thin.</title>
<headline>FOCUS-U.S. distillates stocks build but still thin.</headline>
<byline>Tony McAuley</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inventory figures from the American Petroleum Institute on Tuesday showed a build in distillate stocks last week of nearly three million barrels, above analysts expectations but still leaving stocks well down on last year's levels.</p>
<p>&quot;Eyeballing the numbers and looking at the way ACCESS is trading it seems heating oil is more than most people's expectations,&quot; said Gerry Samuels, an analyst at ARB Oil.</p>
<p>A Reuters survey of traders and analysts earlier Tuesday found the forecast average was for a 2.2 million-barrel build.</p>
</text>
